{"title": "Weakened Intelligence", "pageid": 29891, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Weakened_Intelligence", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Weakened_Intelligence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Weakened_Intelligence.webp/300px-Weakened_Intelligence.webp, /w/images/0/0f/Weakened_Intelligence.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Weakened_Intelligence.webp/300px-Weakened_Intelligence.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Weakened_Intelligence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Weakened Intelligence</b> is a special passive feature gained when failing a particular saving throw while in the Zaith'isk. It decreases your intelligence by 2 permanently, until this feature is removed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> has been reduced by 2 by the <a href=\"/wiki/Zaith%27isk\" title=\"Zaith'isk\">Zaith'isk</a>. The githyanki device failed to harm your illithid parasite - perhaps consuming more would mend your broken mind. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CRE_BrainDamage_INT</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CRE_BrainDamage_INT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CRE_BrainDamage_INT\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Can be removed by consuming a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/25px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/38px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/50px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/25px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a>. Requires using the tadpole to unlock an <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid power\">Illithid power</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195638\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 629/1000000\nPost‐expand 